{"seq":11,"slug":"scalability-engineering","title":"可伸缩性工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"可伸缩性工程-简介\">可伸缩性工程 简介</h1><p>可伸缩性工程是云与基础设施领域的核心学科，专注于使系统在负载增长时仍能保持可预测的性能、可靠性与成本效率。不同于简单的&quot;加机器&quot;，真正的可伸缩性需要在容量规划、弹性防护、流量调度与数据分治等维度进行系统性设计。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向具有分布式系统基础的后端工程师、SRE 和架构师，从工程实践角度深入探讨四大支柱性主题。</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 容量规划</strong>系统地介绍负载建模与预测方法、资源弹性伸缩策略，以及如何通过右sizing和FinOps实践达成成本最优。在AI驱动的突发流量模式下，传统的线性容量模型已不再适用，本章将展示现代预测技术和自动化弹性架构。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 弹性模式</strong>深入讲解熔断器的状态机设计与生产调优、多层次服务降级策略，以及限流与背压的协同机制。微服务架构中级联故障是最致命的威胁，本章提供完整的故障隔离与自愈方案。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 负载均衡</strong>对比分析从Round Robin到P2C、Maglev Hash等算法的适用场景，覆盖L4/L7两层负载均衡的架构选型，并深入服务网格中的智能流量管理能力。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 数据层扩展</strong>聚焦分片策略选型（Hash、Range、一致性哈希）与热点处理、读写分离架构的一致性权衡，以及多级缓存体系的设计原则。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先从容量规划建立全局视角，再通过弹性模式掌握故障防御手段，然后学习负载均衡的流量调度技术，最后深入数据层扩展解决存储瓶颈。四章内容相互关联，构成完整的可伸缩性工程知识体系。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capacity-planning","title":"容量规划","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/capacity-planning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"load-modeling-and-forecasting","title":"负载建模与预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/capacity-planning/load-modeling-and-forecasting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elastic-resource-strategies","title":"资源弹性策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/capacity-planning/elastic-resource-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization-and-rightsizing","title":"成本优化与右Sizing","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/capacity-planning/cost-optimization-and-rightsizing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"resilience-patterns","title":"弹性模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/resilience-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-breaker-pattern","title":"熔断器模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/resilience-patterns/circuit-breaker-pattern"},{"seq":2,"slug":"degradation-strategies","title":"降级策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/resilience-patterns/degradation-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-limiting-and-backpressure","title":"限流与背压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/resilience-patterns/rate-limiting-and-backpressure"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"load-balancing","title":"负载均衡","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/load-balancing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algorithm-comparison-and-selection","title":"算法对比与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/load-balancing/algorithm-comparison-and-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-load-balancing","title":"全局负载均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/load-balancing/global-load-balancing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"service-mesh-traffic-management","title":"服务网格流量管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/load-balancing/service-mesh-traffic-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-scaling","title":"数据层扩展","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/data-scaling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sharding-strategies-and-hotspot-handling","title":"分片策略与热点处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/data-scaling/sharding-strategies-and-hotspot-handling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"read-write-separation-architecture","title":"读写分离架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/scalability-engineering/data-scaling/read-write-separation-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cache-layering-system","title":"缓存分层体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructu